          %h3#StructuralRules Structural rules
          %p
            Among the
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structural+rules"} structural rules
            of dependent type theory are (e.g.
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Jacobs98"} Jacobs (1998), p. 122
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#UFP13"} UFP13, A.2.2
            = succeed "):" do
              %a{:href => "#Rijke18"} Rijke (2018), Sec. 1.4
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                the
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/variable+rule"} variable rule
            %li
              %p
                the
                = succeed "," do
