          %center
            %img{:src => "/nlab/files/StructuralTypeInferenceRules-230326b.jpg", :width => "650"}/
          %p
            The weakening and substitution rules are
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/admissible+rules"} admissible rules
          %h3#definitional_equality Definitional equality
          %p In addition, there are judgments for definitional equality of types and of terms:
          %ul
            %li
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
